> 
> From: Bruce Allan <bruce.w.allan@intel.com>
> 
> As part of the driver unload flow, a PF reset is issued which may still cause an
> interrupt to be generated by the device.  Do not clear the interrupt scheme
> until the reset is complete and there are no pending transactions otherwise a
> hardware error may occur.
> 
> Signed-off-by: Bruce Allan <bruce.w.allan@intel.com>
> ---
